 121     : - Click-to-fold (1)
 122     : - List item folding (5)
 123     : - Code block folding (2)
 124     : - Spacebar toggle (1)
 125     : - Fold from any line (2)
 126     : - Nested behavior (2)
 127     : - Status line (5)
